  "boundaries": [
    "Red asserts new second-page reservation against actual old single-page implementation; source baseline includes test registration and new test only at red.",
    "Green-01 runs 100 browser workspace tests before formatter. Final formatted bytes are exercised by browser-regression-01 (175 filtered browser-related tests) and fmt-check-01.",
    "Selection tests execute the production transaction with controlled stop/hide futures, not a running WebView. Existing sharing permission/transport/quiesce tests also ran.",
    "macOS Objective-C bridge compiled during targeted cargo. Hidden create and guarded visibility are source changes, not installed native UI observations.",
    "Windows code changed but no Windows build/runtime executed.",
    "No Agent, App, account, database, installation, full seven checks, dependency changes or Git mutation."
  ]
